## Important Notice

This software includes an **intentionally vulnerable** Flask application (LAB-01)
designed exclusively for **authorized cybersecurity training** within the
RabTech Academy Task 02 scope.

**DO NOT DEPLOY THIS APPLICATION IN PRODUCTION OR ANY PUBLICLY ACCESSIBLE ENVIRONMENT.**

The vulnerabilities in `app.py` are deliberate and documented for educational
purposes only. Using this code outside the authorized, isolated lab environment
violates the Rules of Engagement and may violate applicable laws.

See `docs/authorization.md` and `docs/rules-of-engagement.md` for scope and
testing requirements.